### Home
GET http://localhost:1204


### Register Admin
POST http://localhost:1204/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Admin User",
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "123456"
}


### Login Admin
POST http://localhost:1204/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "123456"
}


### Submit Contact Form (Public)
POST http://localhost:1204/api/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ashish",
  "email": "ashish@example.com",
  "subject": "Need website development",
  "message": "I want a MERN website for my business."
}


### Get All Contact Submissions (Admin)
GET http://localhost:1204/api/contacts


### Get Single Contact Submission (Admin)
GET http://localhost:1204/api/contacts/PASTE_CONTACT_ID_HERE


### Update Contact Status (Admin)
PUT http://localhost:1204/api/contacts/PASTE_CONTACT_ID_HERE/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "read"
}


### Delete Contact Submission (Admin)
DELETE http://localhost:1204/api/contacts/PASTE_CONTACT_ID_HERE


### Logout Admin
POST http://localhost:1204/api/auth/logout